        <span class="section-tag">02. Skills</span>
      </div>
      <div class="skills-categories">
        <div class="skill-category">
          <h3 class="category-title"><i data-feather="code"></i> Frontend</h3>
          <div class="skill-tags">
            <span class="skill-tag">HTML5</span><span class="skill-tag">CSS3</span><span class="skill-tag">JavaScript</span><span class="skill-tag">TypeScript</span><span class="skill-tag">React.js</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="skill-category">
          <h3 class="category-title"><i data-feather="server"></i> Backend</h3>
          <div class="skill-tags">
            <span class="skill-tag">Node.js</span><span class="skill-tag">Express.js</span><span class="skill-tag">Python</span><span class="skill-tag">Java</span><span class="skill-tag">REST API</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="skill-category">
          <h3 class="category-title"><i data-feather="database"></i> Database</h3>
          <div class="skill-tags">
            <span class="skill-tag">MySQL</span><span class="skill-tag">PostgreSQL</span><span class="skill-tag">MongoDB</span><span class="skill-tag">SQL</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="skill-category">
          <h3 class="category-title"><i data-feather="tool"></i> Tools</h3>
          <div class="skill-tags">
            <span class="skill-tag">Git</span><span class="skill-tag">GitHub</span><span class="skill-tag">Docker</span><span class="skill-tag">VS Code</span><span class="skill-tag">Figma</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="projects">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-tag">03. Projects</span>
      </div>
      <div class="projects-grid">
        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="project-header">
            <div class="project-icon"><i data-feather="shopping-cart"></i></div>
            <div class="project-links">
              <a href="#" target="_blank"><i data-feather="github"></i></a>
              <a href="#" target="_blank"><i data-feather="external-link"></i></a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="project-title">BelanjaRia</h3>
          <p class="project-desc">Aplikasi toko online full-stack dengan fitur manajemen produk, keranjang belanja, dan payment gateway sederhana.</p>
          <div class="project-tags"><span>React.js</span><span>Node.js</span><span>MongoDB</span><span>Express</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="project-header">
            <div class="project-icon"><i data-feather="bar-chart-2"></i></div>
            <div class="project-links">
              <a href="#" target="_blank"><i data-feather="github"></i></a>
              <a href="#" target="_blank"><i data-feather="external-link"></i></a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="project-title">Food App</h3>
          <p class="project-desc">Aplikasi makanan dengan fitur pemesanan, pelacakan pesanan, dan sistem rating restoran.</p>
          <div class="project-tags"><span>React Native</span><span>Node.js</span><span>PostgreSQL</span><span>Mapbox</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="project-header">
            <div class="project-icon"><i data-feather="message-circle"></i></div>
            <div class="project-links">
              <a href="https://github.com/Syahril2401/ASL_SignLanguage" target="_blank"><i data-feather="github"></i></a>
              <a href="#" target="_blank"><i data-feather="external-link"></i></a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="project-title">AI Handsign Recognition</h3>
          <p class="project-desc">Aplikasi pengenalan tanda tangan menggunakan kecerdasan buatan dan teknologi computer vision.</p>
          <div class="project-tags"><span>Python</span><span>TensorFlow</span><span>OpenCV</span><span>MediaPipe</span><span>Flask</span><span>Scikit-learn</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="project-header">
            <div class="project-icon"><i data-feather="book-open"></i></div>
            <div class="project-links">
              <a href="https://github.com/YudhaLaurens/LibraryFinpro" target="_blank"><i data-feather="github"></i></a>
              <a href="#" target="_blank"><i data-feather="external-link"></i></a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="project-title">Library Management System</h3>
          <p class="project-desc">Sistem manajemen perpustakaan dengan CRUD buku, manajemen peminjaman, dan sistem pencarian berbasis kategori.</p>
          <div class="project-tags"><span>Laravel</span><span>PHP</span><span>MySQL</span><span>Vite</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="project-header">
            <div class="project-icon"><i data-feather="leaf"></i></div>
            <div class="project-links">
              <a href="https://github.com/SAMUEL71444/softeng-Finpro-foodwaste" target="_blank"><i data-feather="github"></i></a>
              <a href="https://softeng-finpro-foodwaste-final.vercel.app/" target="_blank"><i data-feather="external-link"></i></a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="project-title">ResQ-Food</h3>
          <p class="project-desc">Platform food waste untuk menyelamatkan makanan dan meminimalkan pemborosan. Pengguna dapat menemukan makanan diskon dari toko sekitar berdasarkan lokasi.</p>
          <div class="project-tags"><span>Next.js</span><span>React</span><span>Tailwind CSS</span><span>Vercel</span></div>
        </article>
      </div> 
      <div class="projects-cta">
        <a href="https://github.com/yudha-laurens" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline"><i data-feather="github"></i> Lihat Semua di GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt" id="experience">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-tag">04. Experience</span>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-progress" id="timeline-progress"></div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
