            <span class="timeline-date">September 2023 - Januari 2024</span>
            <h3 class="timeline-title">SDS Visual - PT Selda Design & Digital Marketing</h3>
            <h4 class="timeline-subtitle">PT Selda Design & Digital Marketing</h4>
            <p>Membantu dalam content production untuk client dalam berbagai platforms dan membantu dalam proses photoshoot.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item education">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <span class="timeline-date">2024 - Sekarang</span>
            <h3 class="timeline-title">S1 Computer Science</h3>
            <h4 class="timeline-subtitle">Universitas Bina Nusantara</h4>
            <p>Semester 5</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item education">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <span class="timeline-date">2024</span>
            <h3 class="timeline-title">SMK Pariwisata Harapan</h3>
            <h4 class="timeline-subtitle">Denpasar, Bali</h4>
